<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait's National Industries '96 net rises.</title>
<headline>Kuwait's National Industries '96 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			    (Million dinars unless stated)</p>
<p>					1996	   1995</p>
<p> Net profit		     25.391	 19.926</p>
<p> Interest income		 0.677	  2.816</p>
<p> Sales			    16.725	 15.517</p>
